{"ok": true, "summary": "建立110×90 mm单相GPU冷板，含3 mm基板、3 mm高微翅片腔及2 mm上盖，φ8接口分置两条短边。将0.6 mm间距解释为净流道宽，设置102×81 mm翅片区；90片实际翅片以45片等体积翅片显示。对比仅更换基板，翅片和上盖保持铜材；金刚石铜密度与价格为假设，热阻仅计满底面一维导热，不代表整板散热性能。", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>1200 W GPU 单相液冷冷板</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\nselect{font:inherit;max-width:175px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:4px}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:12px;z-index:10}\n#report{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;max-width:530px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:right}\ntd,th{padding:3px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}\ntd:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}\n.small{color:#555;margin-top:5px}\n@media(max-width:650px){#report{font-size:10px;max-width:92%;right:4px;bottom:4px;padding:6px}td,th{padding:2px 3px}}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>1200 W GPU 单相微通道冷板</h3>\n<div>基板材料 <select id=\"material\"></select></div>\n<div id=\"size\"></div>\n<div id=\"fins\"></div>\n<div id=\"ports\"></div>\n<div id=\"selected\"></div>\n<div id=\"volume\"></div>\n<div><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></i>铜翅片/壳体；灰：铝；深灰：复合基板</div>\n<div><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></i>蓝：流道/集流腔；黑：示意密封圈</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"explode\">爆炸视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"report\"></div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\n// 长度单位 mm；价格为原料假设，复合材料需供应商确认。\nconst P = {\n  length:110,width:90,base:3,finHeight:3,cover:2,\n  finLength:102,finZone:81,finWidth:0.3,gap:0.6,\n  realFins:90,displayFins:45,wall:2,portID:8,portOD:10,portLength:12,\n  sealRadius:0.35,sealInset:1,power:1200,\n  explodeFin:9,explodeCover:22,\n  materials:[\n    {name:'铜',k:400,rho:8.96,price:75,color:'#b87333'},\n    {name:'铝',k:200,rho:2.70,price:21,color:'#d4d9e0'},\n    {name:'金刚石-铜',k:700,rho:5.50,price:2000,color:'#777e88'}\n  ],\n  metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,fluidColor:'#3b82f6',fluidOpacity:0.55,\n  sealColor:'#111111',electronicColor:'#1f4e79'\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='模型错误：'+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  sun.position.set(100,180,90);scene.add(sun);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;syncRotate();});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const baseGroup=new THREE.Group(),coreGroup=new THREE.Group(),topGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(baseGroup,coreGroup,topGroup);\n  const copper=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#b87333',metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const baseMat=copper.clone();\n  const fluidMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.fluidColor,transparent:true,opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false,roughness:0.3});\n  const sealMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.sealColor,metalness:0,roughness:0.6});\n  function box(w,h,d,x,y,z,mat,parent){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),mat);\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  box(P.length,P.base,P.width,0,P.base/2,0,baseMat,baseGroup);\n  const yCore=P.base+P.finHeight/2;\n  const innerL=P.length-2*P.wall,innerW=P.width-2*P.wall;\n  // 显示翅片厚度/节距均扩大两倍，保持金属体积与孔隙率，不保持换热面积。\n  const factor=P.realFins/P.displayFins;\n  const eqWidth=P.finWidth*factor,eqPitch=(P.finWidth+P.gap)*factor;\n  const finMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.finLength,P.finHeight,eqWidth),copper,P.displayFins);\n  const matrix=new THREE.Matrix4();\n  for(let i=0;i<P.displayFins;i++){\n    matrix.makeTranslation(0,yCore,-P.finZone/2+eqPitch*(i+0.5));\n    finMesh.setMatrixAt(i,matrix);\n  }\n  finMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;finMesh.computeBoundingSphere();coreGroup.add(finMesh);\n  box(innerL,P.finHeight,innerW,0,yCore,0,fluidMat,coreGroup);\n  box(P.length,P.finHeight,P.wall,0,yCore,(P.width-P.wall)/2,copper,coreGroup);\n  box(P.length,P.finHeight,P.wall,0,yCore,-(P.width-P.wall)/2,copper,coreGroup);\n  // 短边侧壁开矩形转接窗口；圆管到低矮腔体为概念过渡，待水力优化。\n  for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n    const segment=(innerW-P.portID)/2;\n    for(const side of [-1,1]){\n      box(P.wall,P.finHeight,segment,sign*(P.length-P.wall)/2,yCore,\n        side*(P.portID/2+segment/2),copper,coreGroup);\n    }\n    const outer=P.portOD/2,inner=P.portID/2;\n    const profile=[\n      new THREE.Vector2(inner,0),new THREE.Vector2(outer,0),\n      new THREE.Vector2(outer,P.portLength),new THREE.Vector2(inner,P.portLength),\n      new THREE.Vector2(inner,0)\n    ];\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(profile,40),copper);\n    port.rotation.z=-sign*Math.PI/2;\n    port.position.set(sign*P.length/2,yCore,0);coreGroup.add(port);\n    const water=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(inner,inner,P.portLength,32),fluidMat);\n    water.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    water.position.set(sign*(P.length+P.portLength)/2,yCore,0);coreGroup.add(water);\n  }\n  box(P.length,P.cover,P.width,0,P.base+P.finHeight+P.cover/2,0,copper,topGroup);\n  const sx=P.length/2-P.sealInset,sz=P.width/2-P.sealInset;\n  const sealPath=new THREE.CurvePath();\n  const points=[[-sx,-sz],[sx,-sz],[sx,sz],[-sx,sz],[-sx,-sz]];\n  for(let i=0;i<4;i++){\n    sealPath.add(new THREE.LineCurve3(\n      new THREE.Vector3(points[i][0],P.base+P.finHeight,points[i][1]),\n      new THREE.Vector3(points[i+1][0],P.base+P.finHeight,points[i+1][1])));\n  }\n  const seal=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TubeGeometry(sealPath,64,P.sealRadius,8,false),sealMat);\n  topGroup.add(seal);\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(220,22,0xd8d4cd,0xe6e1d8);\n  grid.position.y=yCore-P.portOD/2-0.5;scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n    const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n    const radius=size.length()/2;\n    const angle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20),Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20))*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=radius/Math.sin(angle)/0.7;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  let cut=false,exploded=false;\n  document.getElementById('cut').onclick=()=>{\n    cut=!cut;topGroup.visible=!cut;\n    document.getElementById('cut').textContent=cut?'完整视图':'剖切视图';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;coreGroup.position.y=exploded?P.explodeFin:0;\n    topGroup.position.y=exploded?P.explodeCover:0;\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'装配视图':'爆炸视图';fit();\n  };\n  function syncRotate(){document.getElementById('rotate').style.borderColor=controls.autoRotate?'#b11f4b':'#dedede';}\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;syncRotate();};\n  const area=P.length*P.width,baseVolume=area*P.base;\n  const finVolume=P.realFins*P.finWidth*P.finHeight*P.finLength;\n  const chamberVolume=innerL*innerW*P.finHeight-finVolume;\n  const records=P.materials.map(m=>({\n    ...m,mass:baseVolume*m.rho/1e6,resistance:(P.base/1000)/(m.k*area/1e6),\n    cost:baseVolume*m.rho/1e6*m.price\n  }));\n  const select=document.getElementById('material');\n  records.forEach((m,i)=>select.add(new Option(m.name,i)));\n  function updateMaterial(){\n    const m=records[Number(select.value)];baseMat.color.set(m.color);\n    document.getElementById('selected').textContent=`基板 ${m.mass.toFixed(4)} kg · ${(m.resistance*P.power).toFixed(3)} K温差`;\n  }\n  select.onchange=updateMaterial;updateMaterial();\n  document.getElementById('size').textContent=`板体 ${P.length}×${P.width}×${P.base+P.finHeight+P.cover} mm；${P.power} W`;\n  document.getElementById('fins').textContent=`实际90片0.3/0.6 mm → 显示45片0.6/1.2 mm`;\n  document.getElementById('ports').textContent=`双短边 φ${P.portID}内径 / φ${P.portOD}外径；外伸${P.portLength} mm`;\n  document.getElementById('volume').textContent=`腔内净容积 ${(chamberVolume/1000).toFixed(3)} mL（不含接口）`;\n  const rows=records.map(m=>`<tr><td>${m.name}</td><td>${m.mass.toFixed(4)}</td><td>${m.resistance.toFixed(6)}</td><td>${(m.resistance*P.power).toFixed(3)}</td><td>${m.cost.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join('');\n  document.getElementById('report').innerHTML=`\n    <b>仅基板对比｜翅片、上盖与侧壁固定为铜</b>\n    <table><tr><th>材料</th><th>kg</th><th>K/W</th><th>ΔT/K</th><th>原料/元</th></tr>${rows}</table>\n    <div class=\"small\">R=t/(kA)，A=${area} mm²，假设1200 W均匀通过整个底面。<br>\n    铜/铝/复合：k=400/200/700 W/(m·K)，ρ=8.96/2.70/5.50 g/cm³。<br>\n    假设原料价75/21/2000元/kg；复合密度与价格待定，不含加工、连接及损耗。<br>\n    相对铜：铝原料省${(records[0].cost-records[1].cost).toFixed(2)}元；复合增${(records[2].cost-records[0].cost).toFixed(2)}元。<br>\n    等效翅片仅用于显示，实际侧面换热面积${(2*P.realFins*P.finLength*P.finHeight/1e6).toFixed(5)} m²。<br>\n    未计TIM、扩散与对流热阻；不能据此确认1200 W能力。φ8到3 mm腔需转接设计。</div>`;\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();fit();\n  });\n  syncRotate();\n  function animate(){requestAnimationFrame(animate);controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);}\n  animate();\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "铜基板", "value": "0.266112", "unit": "kg", "note": "R=0.000758 K/W；假设75元/kg，19.96元"}, {"label": "铝基板", "value": "0.080190", "unit": "kg", "note": "R=0.001515 K/W；假设21元/kg，1.68元"}, {"label": "金刚石-铜基板", "value": "0.163350", "unit": "kg", "note": "假设ρ5.50、2000元/kg；326.70元"}, {"label": "金刚石-铜基板热阻", "value": "0.000433", "unit": "K/W", "note": "满底面一维导热；1200 W温差0.519 K"}, {"label": "实际翅片双侧换热面积", "value": "0.05508", "unit": "m²", "note": "90片×102×3×2；不含顶面与底面"}, {"label": "主腔净容积", "value": "19.086", "unit": "mL", "note": "106×86×3减实际翅片体积；不含接口"}], "suggestions": ["按实际GPU接触面积重算扩散热阻", "增加流量参数并估算压降和温升", "将φ8接口改为上盖进出并优化集流腔"], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\n建立110×90 mm单相GPU冷板，含3 mm基板、3 mm高微翅片腔及2 mm上盖，φ8接口分置两条短边。将0.6 mm间距解释为净流道宽，设置102×81 mm翅片区；90片实际翅片以45片等体积翅片显示。对比仅更换基板，翅片和上盖保持铜材；金刚石铜密度与价格为假设，热阻仅计满底面一维导热，不代表整板散热性能。\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>1200 W GPU 单相液冷冷板</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}\nh3{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:14px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\nselect{font:inherit;max-width:175px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:4px}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:#fff;padding:12px;z-index:10}\n#report{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;max-width:530px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:right}\ntd,th{padding:3px 7px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}\ntd:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}\n.small{color:#555;margin-top:5px}\n@media(max-width:650px){#report{font-size:10px;max-width:92%;right:4px;bottom:4px;padding:6px}td,th{padding:2px 3px}}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>1200 W GPU 单相微通道冷板</h3>\n<div>基板材料 <select id=\"material\"></select></div>\n<div id=\"size\"></div>\n<div id=\"fins\"></div>\n<div id=\"ports\"></div>\n<div id=\"selected\"></div>\n<div id=\"volume\"></div>\n<div><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#b87333\"></i>铜翅片/壳体；灰：铝；深灰：复合基板</div>\n<div><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></i>蓝：流道/集流腔；黑：示意密封圈</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"cut\">剖切视图</button><button id=\"explode\">爆炸视图</button><button id=\"rotate\">自动旋转</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"report\"></div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\n// 长度单位 mm；价格为原料假设，复合材料需供应商确认。\nconst P = {\n  length:110,width:90,base:3,finHeight:3,cover:2,\n  finLength:102,finZone:81,finWidth:0.3,gap:0.6,\n  realFins:90,displayFins:45,wall:2,portID:8,portOD:10,portLength:12,\n  sealRadius:0.35,sealInset:1,power:1200,\n  explodeFin:9,explodeCover:22,\n  materials:[\n    {name:'铜',k:400,rho:8.96,price:75,color:'#b87333'},\n    {name:'铝',k:200,rho:2.70,price:21,color:'#d4d9e0'},\n    {name:'金刚石-铜',k:700,rho:5.50,price:2000,color:'#777e88'}\n  ],\n  metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,fluidColor:'#3b82f6',fluidOpacity:0.55,\n  sealColor:'#111111',electronicColor:'#1f4e79'\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='模型错误：'+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.prepend(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  scene.environment=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer).fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  sun.position.set(100,180,90);scene.add(sun);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;syncRotate();});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const baseGroup=new THREE.Group(),coreGroup=new THREE.Group(),topGroup=new THREE.Group();\n  modelGroup.add(baseGroup,coreGroup,topGroup);\n  const copper=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#b87333',metalness:P.metalness,roughness:P.roughness});\n  const baseMat=copper.clone();\n  const fluidMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.fluidColor,transparent:true,opacity:P.fluidOpacity,depthWrite:false,roughness:0.3});\n  const sealMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.sealColor,metalness:0,roughness:0.6});\n  function box(w,h,d,x,y,z,mat,parent){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),mat);\n    mesh.position.set(x,y,z);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  box(P.length,P.base,P.width,0,P.base/2,0,baseMat,baseGroup);\n  const yCore=P.base+P.finHeight/2;\n  const innerL=P.length-2*P.wall,innerW=P.width-2*P.wall;\n  // 显示翅片厚度/节距均扩大两倍，保持金属体积与孔隙率，不保持换热面积。\n  const factor=P.realFins/P.displayFins;\n  const eqWidth=P.finWidth*factor,eqPitch=(P.finWidth+P.gap)*factor;\n  const finMesh=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(P.finLength,P.finHeight,eqWidth),copper,P.displayFins);\n  const matrix=new THREE.Matrix4();\n  for(let i=0;i<P.displayFins;i++){\n    matrix.makeTranslation(0,yCore,-P.finZone/2+eqPitch*(i+0.5));\n    finMesh.setMatrixAt(i,matrix);\n  }\n  finMesh.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;finMesh.computeBoundingSphere();coreGroup.add(finMesh);\n  box(innerL,P.finHeight,innerW,0,yCore,0,fluidMat,coreGroup);\n  box(P.length,P.finHeight,P.wall,0,yCore,(P.width-P.wall)/2,copper,coreGroup);\n  box(P.length,P.finHeight,P.wall,0,yCore,-(P.width-P.wall)/2,copper,coreGroup);\n  // 短边侧壁开矩形转接窗口；圆管到低矮腔体为概念过渡，待水力优化。\n  for(const sign of [-1,1]){\n    const segment=(innerW-P.portID)/2;\n    for(const side of [-1,1]){\n      box(P.wall,P.finHeight,segment,sign*(P.length-P.wall)/2,yCore,\n        side*(P.portID/2+segment/2),copper,coreGroup);\n    }\n    const outer=P.portOD/2,inner=P.portID/2;\n    const profile=[\n      new THREE.Vector2(inner,0),new THREE.Vector2(outer,0),\n      new THREE.Vector2(outer,P.portLength),new THREE.Vector2(inner,P.portLength),\n      new THREE.Vector2(inner,0)\n    ];\n    const port=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.LatheGeometry(profile,40),copper);\n    port.rotation.z=-sign*Math.PI/2;\n    port.position.set(sign*P.length/2,yCore,0);coreGroup.add(port);\n    const water=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(inner,inner,P.portLength,32),fluidMat);\n    water.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n    water.position.set(sign*(P.length+P.portLength)/2,yCore,0);coreGroup.add(water);\n  }\n  box(P.length,P.cover,P.width,0,P.base+P.finHeight+P.cover/2,0,copper,topGroup);\n  const sx=P.length/2-P.sealInset,sz=P.width/2-P.sealInset;\n  const sealPath=new THREE.CurvePath();\n  const points=[[-sx,-sz],[sx,-sz],[sx,sz],[-sx,sz],[-sx,-sz]];\n  for(let i=0;i<4;i++){\n    sealPath.add(new THREE.LineCurve3(\n      new THREE.Vector3(points[i][0],P.base+P.finHeight,points[i][1]),\n      new THREE.Vector3(points[i+1][0],P.base+P.finHeight,points[i+1][1])));\n  }\n  const seal=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.TubeGeometry(sealPath,64,P.sealRadius,8,false),sealMat);\n  topGroup.add(seal);\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(220,22,0xd8d4cd,0xe6e1d8);\n  grid.position.y=yCore-P.portOD/2-0.5;scene.add(grid);\n  function fit(){\n    const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n    const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n    const radius=size.length()/2;\n    const angle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20),Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20))*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=radius/Math.sin(angle)/0.7;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  let cut=false,exploded=false;\n  document.getElementById('cut').onclick=()=>{\n    cut=!cut;topGroup.visible=!cut;\n    document.getElementById('cut').textContent=cut?'完整视图':'剖切视图';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;coreGroup.position.y=exploded?P.explodeFin:0;\n    topGroup.position.y=exploded?P.explodeCover:0;\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'装配视图':'爆炸视图';fit();\n  };\n  function syncRotate(){document.getElementById('rotate').style.borderColor=controls.autoRotate?'#b11f4b':'#dedede';}\n  document.getElementById('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;syncRotate();};\n  const area=P.length*P.width,baseVolume=area*P.base;\n  const finVolume=P.realFins*P.finWidth*P.finHeight*P.finLength;\n  const chamberVolume=innerL*innerW*P.finHeight-finVolume;\n  const records=P.materials.map(m=>({\n    ...m,mass:baseVolume*m.rho/1e6,resistance:(P.base/1000)/(m.k*area/1e6),\n    cost:baseVolume*m.rho/1e6*m.price\n  }));\n  const select=document.getElementById('material');\n  records.forEach((m,i)=>select.add(new Option(m.name,i)));\n  function updateMaterial(){\n    const m=records[Number(select.value)];baseMat.color.set(m.color);\n    document.getElementById('selected').textContent=`基板 ${m.mass.toFixed(4)} kg · ${(m.resistance*P.power).toFixed(3)} K温差`;\n  }\n  select.onchange=updateMaterial;updateMaterial();\n  document.getElementById('size').textContent=`板体 ${P.length}×${P.width}×${P.base+P.finHeight+P.cover} mm；${P.power} W`;\n  document.getElementById('fins').textContent=`实际90片0.3/0.6 mm → 显示45片0.6/1.2 mm`;\n  document.getElementById('ports').textContent=`双短边 φ${P.portID}内径 / φ${P.portOD}外径；外伸${P.portLength} mm`;\n  document.getElementById('volume').textContent=`腔内净容积 ${(chamberVolume/1000).toFixed(3)} mL（不含接口）`;\n  const rows=records.map(m=>`<tr><td>${m.name}</td><td>${m.mass.toFixed(4)}</td><td>${m.resistance.toFixed(6)}</td><td>${(m.resistance*P.power).toFixed(3)}</td><td>${m.cost.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join('');\n  document.getElementById('report').innerHTML=`\n    <b>仅基板对比｜翅片、上盖与侧壁固定为铜</b>\n    <table><tr><th>材料</th><th>kg</th><th>K/W</th><th>ΔT/K</th><th>原料/元</th></tr>${rows}</table>\n    <div class=\"small\">R=t/(kA)，A=${area} mm²，假设1200 W均匀通过整个底面。<br>\n    铜/铝/复合：k=400/200/700 W/(m·K)，ρ=8.96/2.70/5.50 g/cm³。<br>\n    假设原料价75/21/2000元/kg；复合密度与价格待定，不含加工、连接及损耗。<br>\n    相对铜：铝原料省${(records[0].cost-records[1].cost).toFixed(2)}元；复合增${(records[2].cost-records[0].cost).toFixed(2)}元。<br>\n    等效翅片仅用于显示，实际侧面换热面积${(2*P.realFins*P.finLength*P.finHeight/1e6).toFixed(5)} m²。<br>\n    未计TIM、扩散与对流热阻；不能据此确认1200 W能力。φ8到3 mm腔需转接设计。</div>`;\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;\n    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();fit();\n  });\n  syncRotate();\n  function animate(){requestAnimationFrame(animate);controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);}\n  animate();\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n<<<METRICS>>>\n[\n  {\"label\":\"铜基板\",\"value\":\"0.266112\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"R=0.000758 K/W；假设75元/kg，19.96元\"},\n  {\"label\":\"铝基板\",\"value\":\"0.080190\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"R=0.001515 K/W；假设21元/kg，1.68元\"},\n  {\"label\":\"金刚石-铜基板\",\"value\":\"0.163350\",\"unit\":\"kg\",\"note\":\"假设ρ5.50、2000元/kg；326.70元\"},\n  {\"label